OL,3,ASix smugglers jailed for manslaughter
OL,4,Aover worst Channel small boats disaster
OL,5,
OL,6,FSix people traffickers have been found
OL,7,Fguilty in France of causing the deaths
OL,8,Fof 31 migrants in the worst ever
OL,9,Fsmall-boat accident in the Channel.
OL,11,FAt the end of a four-week trial in
OL,12,FParis, the six were convicted of
OL,13,F"involuntary homicide" and given prison
OL,14,Fterms of between six and 10 years.
OL,16,FSeven others were given lesser
OL,17,Fsentences of up to four years, and one
OL,18,Fperson was found not guilty.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
