OL,3,ASix smugglers jailed for manslaughter
OL,4,Aover worst Channel small boats disaster
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe boat went down early in the morning
OL,7,Fon 24 November 2021 after sending
OL,8,Fdistress calls to French and British
OL,9,Fcoastguards. The dead, including a
OL,10,Fchild of seven, were mainly Iraqi Kurds
OL,11,Fbut also included Afghans, Egyptians
OL,12,Fand Iranian Kurds. Only two men
OL,13,Fsurvived.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
